    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-tristis</span></b> , e, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very sad</i>
			or <i>mournful.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: carmen, Cic. poët. Div. 1, 8,
			14.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>very austere</i>
			or <i>morose</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">patruus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Cael. 11, 25</span></i>
			.</div>
